# The dusk hunt with every mind on (the Motion Studio, phase 0, 2026-11-25; docs/plans/motion-studio.md): the pride and
# the herd of LionHuntTests.atDuskAHungryPrideTakesACalfAndFeeds (built by the same code, LionScenes.duskHunt) at 20:00.
# The game runs until each part of the hunt, then is frozen and stepped a tick a picture, each tick taken from three
# cameras round the calf (one take). Every animal drawn from the stalk on is recorded (body_film-*.jsonl.gz beside the
# pictures) for tools/pair_report.py: where each lioness's jaws are against the calf, its feet, its clips.
#   ./gradlew runFilm -PfilmScene=tools/film/lion_hunt.film     pictures in run-film/screenshots/lion_hunt/
# The scene is built and its dice set in the frozen game, so every take starts from the same tick.
# The field's corner is at -46 -62 -32: the cow stands at 0.5 -60 0.5, the calf 2 blocks south of her, the den 40 west.
cmd time set 14000
cmd weather clear
cmd effect give @s minecraft:night_vision infinite 0 true
lens 50
cmd tick freeze
stage lion_hunt -46 -62 -32
seed 7
aim film-calf
cam wide -19 14 -34
cmd tick rate 40
cmd tick unfreeze
until stage=STALK 2400
cmd tick rate 20
record on 1 all
until stage=FIGHT 3000
cmd tick freeze
cam off
cam south 0 2.5 -10
cam east 10 2.5 0
cam above 5 8 -5
burst rush 60 1
cmd tick unfreeze
until holding=true 200
cmd tick freeze
burst hold 80 1
cam off
aim fact stage=FEAST
cam wide -10 8 -14
cmd tick unfreeze
until stage=FEAST 1500
cmd tick freeze
cam off
cam south 0 3 -9
cam east 9 3 0
burst feast 30 4
record off
